<title>USA: Dataworks names Brandel COO.</title>
<headline>Dataworks names Brandel COO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>DataWorks Corp Tuesday said Robert Brandel has been appointed to the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, DataWorks said Brandel was previously vice president and general manager of DataWorks' DCD Division.</p>
</text>
